  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PAF-Support to Strengthen the GeoSinirube Tool, a Precision Geospatial and Geosocial Technology for Addressing Vulnerable Populations in the Face of Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The project will develope GeoSINIRUBE as a tool to know with precision throught Geospatial and Geosocial Technology how vulnerable are different populations and communities to face of Climate Change, including elaborate the Vulnerability Index, which will be developed with UNDP&#x2019;s technical support to establish prioritization criteria for GeoSINIRUBE.</narrative>
  </description>
